## Copy to configure/secret.pya and fill real values.
## This file is loaded after configure/default.pya and overrides defaults.

## Matrix runtime config map (recommended)
su name matrix channel be map def
  su name homeserver ob text "https://matrix.liberit.ca" ya
  su name room ob text "!your_room_id:matrix.liberit.ca" ya
  su name executive username ob text "@andrii:matrix.liberit.ca" ya
  su name token ob text "paste_access_token_here" ya
prah

## Optional fallback scalar facts (legacy-compatible)
exists su name matrix homeserver ob text "https://matrix.liberit.ca" be default ya
exists su name matrix access token ob text "paste_access_token_here" be default ya
exists su name matrix executive username ob text "@andrii:matrix.liberit.ca" be default ya

## If you do not use token-based auth, remove token above and set:
##   su name registration shared secret ob text "paste_shared_secret_here" ya
## inside the matrix channel map.

## matrix.org users:
## - Usually use token auth.
## - Or run: pyash configure matrix and choose password mode to fetch a token.
